# What the build job of release.yml installs to make the CLI's wheel and sdist
# with `python -m build --no-isolation`: build, the build frontend, and
# hatchling, the build backend of pyproject.toml. Without --no-isolation, build
# would install hatchling from PyPI with no hash. requirements-release.txt
# locks them and their dependencies with hashes, and the job installs only from
# it. To change a version, edit this file and compile the lock again: see
# CONTRIBUTING.md, "Python lock files".
build
hatchling
